= Hitler vs <span style="color: #00CCFF;">Bavaria</span>

Right on the next morning the mutineers started marching through various streets of Munich seeking to gather support for their March on Berlin inspirered by Mussolini. During the first combat of the day Ernst Röhm agreed to a short truce. Ludendorff ordered a propaganda march to Odeonsplatz close to Röhm's contingent.

Ludendorff, Göring, Hitler and their troops are now met with a police blockade. Fire is opened.

- @hitler_putsch_done: Counting the dead
- @the_very_good_outcome: Counting the dead

