- @what_happened_to_hitler: What happened to Hitler?

@what_happened_to_hitler
on-arrival: hitler_dead = 1; new_middle_nsdap -= 2; catholic_nsdap -= 3; old_middle_nsdap -= 1

After the police managed to get a hold of Hitlers hiding spot, they have stormed his house to arrest him. They were suprised to find only a body with a bullet in its head. It seems the *Führer*, the shining star of the <span style="color: [+ nsdap_colour +];">Völkisch-movement</span> has ended his life after his defeat.

Let's just hope that the other conspirators will face consequences as well... in a judicial way preferabily....

  






























